tended outcomes (e.g., ordering a ship to advance for 60 seconds while simultaneously retreating within the same timeframe leads to undefined behavior).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Formation Strategy</strong>: Formations work best for fast ships; slow vessels risk being destroyed before deploying. Choose wisely!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Future Updates</strong>:<br>Updates/DLCs will depend on community reception. Planned content includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level System</strong>: Expand with more stages. [V1.073 complete].</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character System</strong>: Add character profiles with art, lore, and unique abilities [V1.07 complete].</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon System</strong>: Introduce new gear and equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ship System</strong>: Add more playable vessels.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Long-Term Vision</strong>:<br>5. <strong>City System</strong>: Requires significant development time/resources.<br>6. <strong>Sovereignty System</strong><br>7. <strong>Economy/Trade System</strong><br>8. <strong>Miscellaneous</strong>: Randomized items, blueprint crafting, ship production, alien ecosystems, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
